    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10916" root="خضل" body-key="x">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اخضلهُ</span></b>  <i>He moistened it;</i> or <i>wetted it;</i> (S,
K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خضّلهُ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَخْضِيلٌ</span>. (TA.)
You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَخْضَلَتْ دُمُوعُهُ لِحْيَتَهُ</span> <i>His tears moistened,</i> or <i>wetted, his beard.</i> (JK, * TA.) And
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَخْضَلْتُهُ السَّمَآءُ</span> <i>The rain wetted him:</i> (TA:) or
<i>wetted him much.</i> (JK.) ＝   
